GStreamer Source Archives
=========================

This directory contains the complete corresponding source code for the GStreamer
@GSTREAMER_VERSION@ binaries installed by the Deep Learning Streamer installer.
Each module carries its own COPYING file at the root of its archive (LGPL-2.1 or
later for all modules listed below); individual source files may carry additional
or differing notices, and gst-plugins-ugly and gst-libav wrap third-party libraries
whose own terms may be more restrictive. Those files are the authoritative statement
of the licensing terms.

The archives are the unmodified upstream release tarballs, downloaded from
https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/src/<module>/<module>-@GSTREAMER_VERSION@.tar.xz
Their SHA256 checksums were verified at package time against the .sha256sum files
published alongside them upstream.

Modules included
----------------
  gstreamer                 core framework
  gst-plugins-base          base plugin set
  gst-plugins-good          good plugin set
  gst-plugins-bad           bad plugin set
  gst-plugins-ugly          ugly plugin set
  gst-libav                 FFmpeg-based plugins
  gst-rtsp-server           RTSP server library
  gst-editing-services      GStreamer Editing Services
  gst-devtools              validation and debugging tools
  gst-python                Python bindings

Local modifications
-------------------
DL Streamer installs a rebuilt gstanalytics-1.0-0.dll (plus its import library,
headers, GIR and typelib) on top of the GStreamer installation.

That library is built from the gst-plugins-bad-@GSTREAMER_VERSION@.tar.xz
archive in this directory, with 0020-gst-analytics.patch (also in this
directory) applied to the extracted tree. Together they are the complete
corresponding source for the modified library. The build recipe is
dependencies/windows/build_gstanalytics_zip.ps1 in the repository.

Rust plugins (gst-plugins-rs)
-----------------------------
The GStreamer runtime also ships plugins built from gst-plugins-rs. That module
is versioned independently of GStreamer @GSTREAMER_VERSION@ and a release tarball 
is not published, so it is not included here. Its source is available from
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gst-plugins-rs
Run "gst-inspect-1.0 <plugin>" on any of these plugins to obtain the exact
version to check out.
